   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">I am using ggplot to create maps for visualizing the output of a predictive model for spatial data. I would like to visualize the mean and variance (error) of the data simultaneously. One method for doing this would be to use an HSL model for my scale_color_gradientn() where hue is mapped to the mean and either saturation or luminance is mapped to variance. Is it possible to map the aspects of a color to different variables in ggplot?<div><br></div><div>For the sake of a minimal working example, I&#39;ve borrowed from the documentation for scale_colour_gradientn().</div><div><br></div><div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">library(ggplot2)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">library(RColorBrewer)</span></div></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">dsub</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/subset\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/subset&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370474210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11kFL_p3EPsZBIOj1qRJyv\">subset</a></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">diamonds</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,20,181);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,20,181);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">6</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&gt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,20,181);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&amp;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">y</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&lt;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(21,20,181);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">6</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">dsub &lt;- mutate(dsub, var=x, diff=</span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/MathFun\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/MathFun&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370474210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zHnpiD4y-1Vpok5_7Jne5\">sqrt</a></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/MathFun\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/MathFun&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370474210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3zHnpiD4y-1Vpok5_7Jne5\">abs</a></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">x</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">-</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">y</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">)</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">)</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">*</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><a href=\"http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/sign\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.inside-r.org/r-doc/base/sign&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370474210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw344bjQdiJGsoHiEKR-faP4\">sign</a></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">x</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">-</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">y</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">)</span><span style=\"background-color:rgb(245,245,245);color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap\">)</span></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">d</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"><a href=\"http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.2.1/qplot.html\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://docs.ggplot2.org/0.9.2.1/qplot.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792370474210000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0Uk52Py9YD2eLKiFIi186X\">qplot</a></span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">x</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">y</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">data</span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">dsub</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\"> </span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">colour</span><span style=\"color:rgb(38,77,102);font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">diff</span><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">)</span><br></div><div><span style=\"color:black;font-family:Menlo,Monaco,Consolas,&#39;Courier New&#39;,monospace;font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre-wrap;background-color:rgb(245,245,245)\">d + scale_color_gradientn(colours=brewer.pal(7,&quot;YlOrRd&quot;))<br></span></div><div><br></div><div>Note that there is now a variable &quot;var&quot; in dsub, which I&#39;d like to map to luminance or saturation, or otherwise visualize simultaneously with diff.</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers,</div><div>Gregory</div><div><br></div></div>"
